  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solar Water Pumps for Improved Livelihoods of Smallholder farmers in Rural Zambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This venture aims to promote access to clean energy as the nexus for powering sustainable agricultural activities targeting high-value chains. Kawaida will install and maintain off-grid clean energy solutions to support the mechanization of agriculture value chain processes for remote and rural smallholder farmers and cooperatives involved in the production of soyabeans, sunflower, groundnuts, and fish</narrative>
  </description>
